<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets Amoy Properties warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets Amoy Properties warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Thursday it issued 380 million American-style call warrants on shares of Amoy Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$8.415	  PREMIUM	10.00 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$0.2475	 GEARING	4.00X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     13.FEB.98	 BOARD LOT    5,000</p>
<p> LISTING	  HONG KONG	 PAY DATE     11.MAR.97</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE     HK$9.90	   LISTING DATE 13.MAR.97</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT     CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
